<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
  <title>KAIZEN — About</title>
</head>
<body class="app-page">
  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>
  <main class="app-main">
    <div class="page-header">
      <div>
        <h1>About KAIZEN</h1>
        <p class="page-sub">The philosophy behind the platform</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card card-gold">
      <div class="card-header">
        <h2>What is Kaizen?</h2>
      </div>
      <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:20px;">
        Kaizen (改善) is a Japanese philosophy meaning <strong style="color:var(--text-primary);">continuous improvement</strong>.
        Applied to trading, it means building discipline through small, consistent, daily habits
        rather than chasing dramatic wins.
      </p>
      <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:20px;">
        Kaizen is a discipline-focused trading platform that helps traders build consistency
        through session journaling, a Discipline Score system, and Zero Authority DAO integration
        that surfaces on-chain bounties as trading challenges and verifies reputation on-chain.
      </p>
      <p style="color:var(--text-secondary);font-size:0.95rem;line-height:1.9;">
        Built during the <strong style="color:var(--gold);">Zero Authority DAO BuildSprint</strong>.
        Powered by real ZA API data. Designed for serious traders.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card" style="margin-top:2px;">
      <div class="card-header"><h2>The Philosophy</h2></div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2px;">
        <div style="background:var(--bg-surface);padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--border);">
          <div style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.65rem;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:8px;">改 — Change</div>
          <p style="font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.7;">Every session is an opportunity to change one bad habit. Data-driven, not emotional.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:var(--bg-surface);padding:20px;border:1px solid var(--border);">
          <div style="font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.65rem;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:8px;">善 — Good</div>
          <p style="font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--text-secondary);line-height:1.7;">The goal is not perfection. It is the consistent pursuit of better execution and discipline.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <script src="/js/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
